  "title": "What is Progressive Design-Build and When to Consider It for Your Transmission or Distribution Project",
  "summary": "Utility Projects Can Reap Benefits by Bringing Construction Expertise into a Collaborative Design Process With limited internal resources and more projects to construct than ever before, more electrical utilities are turning to alternative delivery methods for their transmission and distribution projects. These alternatives include design-build, engineer-procure-construct (EPC), construction manager at risk (CMAR), and progressive design-build […]",
